  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 712.18 Monitoring and Compliance Determination for Disinfection Byproducts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 712.18 Monitoring and Compliance Determination for Disinfection Byproducts.\n\n(a) The O/O of a community water system shall monitor for disinfection byproducts as specified in Env-Dw 715.\n\n(b) Compliance with the disinfection byproduct monitoring requirements shall be as specified in Env-Dw 715.\n\nSource. #9700, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12668, eff 1-1-19 (formerly Env-Dw 712.17)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
